    "h1": { "en": "Frame", "zh": "框架" },
    "lede": { "en": "Four 2040 aluminum extrusions form the base frame, and every other part mounts onto it. Make sure that all four corners are square: they are the foundation for accurate motion later.", "zh": "四根 2040 铝型材拼成底座框架，其余零件都装在框架上。确认框架四角成直角。方正的框架是后续运动精度的基础。" }
  },
